  "story": {
    "text": "In Year 4, at Niar, Brocan of Liarning feasted Ten of Kiangratheth as a guest, and had them slain at the table: the Feast of Niar. That same year, Ten of Kiangratheth was killed by slain at a feast under the guest-right at the age of 48. In Year 14, a plot was laid against the life of Brocan of Liarning, the Plot against Brocan, the work of a hand no one could name. In Year 15, the truth of the Plot against Brocan came out at last: Tinki of Kiangratheth was behind it. In Year 18, Marncall of Liarning challenged Tinki of Kiangratheth to a duel (to the death), to be fought at Gerrouhaven in a year and a day. And so, in Year 19, Marncall of Liarning fought Tinki of Kiangratheth to the death at Gerrouhaven. Marncall of Liarning won, and Tinki of Kiangratheth was maimed.",
